# Upload ONLY what the web build needs.
#
# The Vercel CLI does not read .gitignore - only this file. Without it every
# `vercel deploy` uploaded build/ (17,914 files after an Android build, which
# blew Vercel's 15,000-file limit), .dart_tool/, and git-ignored secrets such
# as .env (API keys) and deploy.sh.
#
# Allowlist: everything at the top level is ignored, then only these are let
# back in, so anything new dropped in this folder stays off Vercel by default.
/*
!/lib
!/web
!/api
!/pubspec.yaml
!/pubspec.lock
!/vercel.json
!/vercel-build.sh
!/cache-bust-web.sh
!/analysis_options.yaml
